WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.991
I hereby decree that
Prime Minister Cao Cao,

2
00:00:14.075 --> 00:00:16.658
...lead the Imperial Army,

3
00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.825
...to pacify the rebels Liu Bei
and Sun Quan.

4
00:00:19.908 --> 00:00:21.366
Thank you, Your Majesty.

5
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:41.950
These people are loyal to the Han Empire.

6
00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:44.491
They followed us to
escape Cao Cao's regime.

7
00:00:45.533 --> 00:00:47.408
If we do not protect civilians,

8
00:00:47.491 --> 00:00:49.366
...then what is the meaning of this war?

9
00:00:52.366 --> 00:00:55.366
An alliance will strengthen us both.

10
00:01:02.908 --> 00:01:07.366
When a loser joins forces with a coward,

11
00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:08.658
...what can they accomplish?

12
00:01:09.408 --> 00:01:12.741
What the Southlands need is unity!

13
00:01:17.783 --> 00:01:19.491
My decision to fight is final.

14
00:01:19.533 --> 00:01:22.366
Anyone who dares mention surrender...

15
00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:25.575
...will end up like this table!

16
00:01:28.908 --> 00:01:30.991
You need to fight this war.

17
00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:34.825
I am not afraid of him.

18
00:01:34.866 --> 00:01:36.866
I have been waiting for this day!

19
00:01:38.325 --> 00:01:41.825
We shall fight, not waste time with words.

20
00:01:50.908 --> 00:01:53.866
Make camp there!

21
00:01:53.950 --> 00:01:56.075
On the bank facing Red Cliff.

22
00:01:58.908 --> 00:02:00.491
Tomorrow we may be enemies.

23
00:02:00.575 --> 00:02:02.491
If that day ever comes,

24
00:02:02.533 --> 00:02:04.908
...it will be each man for himself

25
00:02:06.575 --> 00:02:08.325
Cao Cao has no experience in naval warfare.

26
00:02:08.366 --> 00:02:10.366
He must rely on Admirals
Cai Mao and Zhang Yun.

27
00:02:10.450 --> 00:02:12.700
If I can eliminate them,

28
00:02:12.783 --> 00:02:15.075
...his navy will be powerless

29
00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:56.075
Nice play!

30
00:03:06.783 --> 00:03:07.741
Goal!

31
00:03:07.825 --> 00:03:10.616
These little monkeys are getting quicker!

32
00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:12.658
The Prime Minister's order
to practice Cuju...

33
00:03:12.741 --> 00:03:15.950
...has toughened these kids up.

34
00:03:21.533 --> 00:03:23.658
Follow closely.

35
00:03:48.533 --> 00:03:49.991
Carry him inside quickly.

36
00:04:15.783 --> 00:04:16.991
Follow me.

37
00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.533
Just my stomach growling.

38
00:04:47.533 --> 00:04:48.450
Yes!

39
00:04:48.533 --> 00:04:51.491
Goal!

40
00:04:58.783 --> 00:05:00.866
What do you think? Not bad, right?

41
00:05:07.533 --> 00:05:08.783
Block him!

42
00:05:44.783 --> 00:05:46.075
Yeah!

43
00:05:59.783 --> 00:06:01.408
Yeah!

44
00:06:28.616 --> 00:06:31.033
That pot isn't wide enough.

45
00:06:31.075 --> 00:06:34.200
You would miss no matter how wide it was.

46
00:06:34.283 --> 00:06:37.825
Pitch pot is a game for aristocrats...

47
00:06:37.908 --> 00:06:41.533
...not for soldiers in wartime.

48
00:06:45.283 --> 00:06:47.825
Your Honor,
how'd you throw that bull's eye?

49
00:06:47.866 --> 00:06:49.408
Concentration.

50
00:06:49.491 --> 00:06:50.908
When the enemy is over-confident,

51
00:06:50.991 --> 00:06:52.991
...we must double our concentration.

52
00:06:53.075 --> 00:06:56.366
With concentration,
you can kill a giant with a pebble.

53
00:06:58.991 --> 00:07:01.700
Your Highness, Zhou Yu's army is small.

54
00:07:01.783 --> 00:07:04.325
He'll have to resort to guerilla warfare.

55
00:07:04.366 --> 00:07:05.825
That last puny victory...

56
00:07:05.866 --> 00:07:07.950
...has made Zhou Yu cocky.

57
00:07:08.033 --> 00:07:09.866
He's no guerilla warrior.

58
00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:13.283
He will confront us face to face.

59
00:07:16.033 --> 00:07:17.575
They are readying for battle.

60
00:07:17.658 --> 00:07:20.366
We need a strategy to counter them.

61
00:07:22.783 --> 00:07:24.991
Cao Cao wants to surround us...

62
00:07:25.075 --> 00:07:26.950
...without breaking the
basic rules of strategy.

63
00:07:27.033 --> 00:07:29.325
The first army to the field will be rested.

64
00:07:29.366 --> 00:07:31.866
The second army will arrive exhausted.

65
00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:33.575
Attack where the enemy is least prepared.

66
00:07:33.658 --> 00:07:34.991
Strike where they least expect it.

67
00:07:35.033 --> 00:07:36.741
We must concentrate all forces...

68
00:07:36.825 --> 00:07:38.533
...on their strongest position.

69
00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:45.325
Naval victory depends on...

70
00:07:45.366 --> 00:07:49.325
...Admirals Cai Mao and Zhang Yun.

71
00:07:49.366 --> 00:07:51.491
We are loyal to Your Highness until death.

72
00:07:52.366 --> 00:07:53.658
Cao Cao underestimates us.

73
00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:56.075
He will never expect us to hit their navy.

74
00:08:05.033 --> 00:08:06.491
What is your name?

75
00:08:06.533 --> 00:08:08.575
Private Sun Shucai.

76
00:08:08.658 --> 00:08:10.533
You are an outstanding player...

77
00:08:10.575 --> 00:08:13.325
...and a good soldier.

78
00:08:13.408 --> 00:08:14.991
From this day forward...

79
00:08:15.075 --> 00:08:18.700
...you are promoted to battalion commander.

80
00:08:18.783 --> 00:08:20.658
Thank you, Your Highness!

81
00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:23.575
Everyone must practice hard at Cuju.

82
00:08:23.658 --> 00:08:26.783
Only with tough bodies can we win this war.

83
00:08:26.866 --> 00:08:29.991
Once the Southlands are subdued,

84
00:08:30.033 --> 00:08:34.866
...your families will be exempt
from taxes for three years.

85
00:08:36.741 --> 00:08:38.950
Thank you, Your Highness!

86
00:09:12.991 --> 00:09:14.491
What are you doing?

87
00:09:15.741 --> 00:09:18.033
I'm... setting these birds free.

88
00:09:19.325 --> 00:09:21.825
That's very kind of you.

89
00:09:29.825 --> 00:09:30.991
You're leaving?

90
00:09:34.033 --> 00:09:37.450
By your accent, I bet you're a Southerner.

91
00:09:37.533 --> 00:09:39.450
That's right.

92
00:09:39.533 --> 00:09:41.491
Southerners are warm-hearted people.

93
00:09:41.575 --> 00:09:43.033
Northerners are free-spirited.

94
00:09:43.075 --> 00:09:44.533
I'm kind of dumb.

95
00:09:44.616 --> 00:09:47.450
People say my entire life...

96
00:09:47.533 --> 00:09:50.325
You're not dumb, just too honest.

97
00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:56.283
You're good at Cuju.

98
00:09:57.366 --> 00:09:58.991
Thanks for heading the ball.

99
00:10:00.366 --> 00:10:01.491
What's your name?

100
00:10:01.575 --> 00:10:02.950
My name is...

101
00:10:04.741 --> 00:10:05.991
Look at the size of me...

102
00:10:06.033 --> 00:10:09.866
My mother calls me Piggy.

103
00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:11.075
Piggy?

104
00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:14.575
So you can play Cuju right?

105
00:10:14.658 --> 00:10:17.700
You kidding? I only know hacky-sack.

106
00:10:17.783 --> 00:10:20.700
Congratulations on your promotion.

107
00:10:20.741 --> 00:10:24.533
So does a commander get bigger meals?

108
00:10:24.616 --> 00:10:25.700
You're a big officer now.

109
00:10:25.783 --> 00:10:28.533
You can eat as much as you want.

110
00:10:28.616 --> 00:10:31.450
Are you fighting just to
fill your stomach?

111
00:10:31.533 --> 00:10:33.408
Mother says my stomach is a bottomless pit.

112
00:10:33.491 --> 00:10:36.533
My family's too poor to feed me.

113
00:10:36.616 --> 00:10:39.283
We're Pit and Piggy!

114
00:10:39.366 --> 00:10:40.658
What a pair!

115
00:10:42.491 --> 00:10:45.533
The new environment has made our men ill.

116
00:10:45.616 --> 00:10:48.200
They are weak from a long war...

117
00:10:48.283 --> 00:10:49.908
...and have lost all immunity.

118
00:10:49.991 --> 00:10:52.200
So typhoid quickly...

119
00:10:52.283 --> 00:10:53.825
Can it be cured?

120
00:10:53.908 --> 00:10:55.491
Yes...

121
00:10:55.533 --> 00:10:57.616
...but not overnight

122
00:11:05.866 --> 00:11:07.825
How many have died?

123
00:11:07.866 --> 00:11:09.950
Over a hundred.

124
00:11:10.033 --> 00:11:11.825
In a few days, it will be out of control.

125
00:11:11.866 --> 00:11:14.283
We must bury them right away.

126
00:11:14.366 --> 00:11:15.741
No burials! We must cremate.

127
00:11:15.825 --> 00:11:18.450
Cremation is the only way
to stop its spread.

128
00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.741
- Ready the funeral pyres.
- Yes, sir

129
00:11:21.825 --> 00:11:23.366
Hold on.

130
00:11:34.283 --> 00:11:35.866
<i>Epidemic outbreak.</i>

131
00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:40.325
The climate has weakened Cao Cao's army.

132
00:11:40.366 --> 00:11:42.741
Disease is rampant Great.

133
00:11:42.825 --> 00:11:46.783
Your Honor, let's seize
this chance and attack.

134
00:11:46.866 --> 00:11:48.616
The navy is still healthy.

135
00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:49.783
We must not act recklessly.

136
00:11:49.866 --> 00:11:52.325
Your Honor, this is the time to attack!

137
00:11:52.366 --> 00:11:53.866
Yes!

138
00:11:53.908 --> 00:11:56.616
This is a battle of honor.

139
00:11:56.700 --> 00:11:58.658
Even war must be fair.

140
00:12:30.658 --> 00:12:32.991
Your Highness...

141
00:12:33.033 --> 00:12:35.866
...isn't this a bit inhumane?

142
00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:39.366
Cast off the soldiers of the dead!

143
00:13:07.283 --> 00:13:08.700
What's the matter?

144
00:13:28.533 --> 00:13:30.033
Pull the boats here.

145
00:13:32.825 --> 00:13:33.783
Look, what is that?

146
00:13:33.866 --> 00:13:35.283
Pull it here.

147
00:13:38.908 --> 00:13:40.491
Pull the boats here.

148
00:13:43.366 --> 00:13:45.908
- Go report this to the general.
- Yes, sir.

149
00:14:13.825 --> 00:14:15.908
Pile weapons and armor here.

150
00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:18.325
Put the corpses there.

151
00:14:18.366 --> 00:14:19.783
Yes, sir.

152
00:14:24.700 --> 00:14:26.075
Get away from here.

153
00:14:39.991 --> 00:14:41.325
Don't touch them!

154
00:14:41.366 --> 00:14:43.658
They died from typhoid!

155
00:14:43.741 --> 00:14:45.950
Move! It's contagious!

156
00:14:46.033 --> 00:14:48.283
Move! Don't touch anything!

157
00:14:48.366 --> 00:14:49.658
Get out of here!

158
00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:51.325
Everyone must leave!

159
00:14:52.033 --> 00:14:54.908
Escort these people away!

160
00:14:54.991 --> 00:14:56.325
This is for your own good.

161
00:14:56.533 --> 00:14:57.700
This place is infected.

162
00:14:57.783 --> 00:14:59.033
Leave here immediately.

163
00:15:20.866 --> 00:15:23.491
Cao Cao is truly ruthless.

164
00:15:24.616 --> 00:15:26.700
Those soldiers have touched corpses.

165
00:15:26.783 --> 00:15:27.991
I've quarantined them...

166
00:15:28.075 --> 00:15:30.033
...so they do not infect others

167
00:15:32.408 --> 00:15:34.366
And the villagers?

168
00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:36.491
I fear many have already been infected.

169
00:15:36.575 --> 00:15:40.491
Cao Cao has stooped to evil tricks.

170
00:15:40.533 --> 00:15:42.200
This is psychological warfare.

171
00:15:42.283 --> 00:15:44.408
He's attacking our morale.

172
00:15:46.741 --> 00:15:48.991
How to dispose of the bodies?

173
00:15:49.075 --> 00:15:50.825
These are the bodies of our enemies.

174
00:15:50.866 --> 00:15:52.908
Feed them to the fishes.

175
00:15:52.991 --> 00:15:55.616
No, we must lay them to rest.

176
00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:57.450
No burials.

177
00:15:57.533 --> 00:15:58.991
We must cremate them.

178
00:16:47.533 --> 00:16:50.325
I lift my drink and sing a song.

179
00:16:50.366 --> 00:16:53.491
For who knows if life be short or long?

180
00:16:54.908 --> 00:16:57.366
Man's life is but the morning dew.

181
00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:00.575
Past days many, future ones few.

182
00:17:02.533 --> 00:17:03.991
The melancholy my heart begets.

183
00:17:04.075 --> 00:17:06.825
Comes from cares I cannot forget.

184
00:17:06.866 --> 00:17:09.366
Who can unravel these woes of mine?

185
00:17:09.450 --> 00:17:13.450
I know but one man... the God of Wine!

186
00:17:14.783 --> 00:17:16.950
Disciples dressed in blue.

187
00:17:17.033 --> 00:17:19.700
My heart worries for you.

188
00:17:19.783 --> 00:17:21.825
You are the cause.

189
00:17:21.908 --> 00:17:24.491
Of this song without pause.

190
00:17:24.533 --> 00:17:26.908
Across the bank a deer bleats...

191
00:17:26.991 --> 00:17:29.450
...in the wilds where it eats.

192
00:17:30.450 --> 00:17:32.658
Honored guests I salute.

193
00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:35.783
Strike the harp! Play the flute!

194
00:17:40.366 --> 00:17:42.616
Bright is the moon's spark.

195
00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:47.283
Never ceasing, never dark.

196
00:17:48.533 --> 00:17:51.408
Thoughts of you from deep inside.

197
00:17:51.491 --> 00:17:54.700
Cannot settle, cannot subside.

198
00:17:56.033 --> 00:17:57.783
Stars around the moon are few.

199
00:17:57.866 --> 00:17:59.991
Southward the crows flew.

200
00:18:00.075 --> 00:18:01.950
Flying with no rest.

201
00:18:02.033 --> 00:18:04.283
Where shall they nest?

202
00:18:04.366 --> 00:18:05.991
No mountain too steep.

203
00:18:06.075 --> 00:18:07.908
No ocean too deep.

204
00:18:07.991 --> 00:18:09.950
Sages rush when guests call.

205
00:18:10.033 --> 00:18:11.825
So at their feet...

206
00:18:14.533 --> 00:18:16.075
...the empire does fall!

207
00:18:36.741 --> 00:18:38.908
Take your time. Careful, it's hot.

208
00:18:44.783 --> 00:18:46.325
More fall sick every day.

209
00:18:46.408 --> 00:18:47.408
You have enough medicine?

210
00:18:47.491 --> 00:18:49.491
Cassia trees are scarce here.

211
00:18:49.533 --> 00:18:51.658
Our men will keep searching.

212
00:18:52.908 --> 00:18:56.450
Can cassia cure typhoid?

213
00:18:56.533 --> 00:18:58.783
It will ease current symptoms.

214
00:18:58.866 --> 00:19:01.825
But a true cure requires other ingredients.

215
00:19:18.991 --> 00:19:21.408
Let me take a look.

216
00:19:35.908 --> 00:19:39.366
Hurry! Carry our men out!

217
00:19:39.408 --> 00:19:40.741
Move it!

218
00:19:40.825 --> 00:19:42.950
Stand up, let's go.

219
00:19:43.033 --> 00:19:44.408
Stop! What do you think you're doing?

220
00:19:44.491 --> 00:19:45.408
What are you doing?

221
00:19:45.491 --> 00:19:48.450
General, what are you doing?

222
00:19:48.533 --> 00:19:50.283
These patients cannot be moved.

223
00:19:50.366 --> 00:19:53.366
Hurry! Put our men on the horses.

224
00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:55.325
Please, these men must not leave.

225
00:19:55.366 --> 00:19:57.825
They are still ill.

226
00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:01.325
You're leaving?

227
00:20:08.991 --> 00:20:13.241
Viceroy, this epidemic
is beyond our control.

228
00:20:15.325 --> 00:20:17.491
I have barely twenty thousand men.

229
00:20:17.533 --> 00:20:20.991
If this continues, I might lose everything.

230
00:20:21.033 --> 00:20:24.616
I must retreat and reformulate my strategy.

231
00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:28.491
You withdraw at a moment like this?

232
00:20:28.533 --> 00:20:30.658
You proposed this alliance.

233
00:20:30.741 --> 00:20:33.283
Now with our lives at stake, you flee?

234
00:20:33.366 --> 00:20:34.783
This is betrayal.

235
00:20:34.866 --> 00:20:36.783
You can't say that.

236
00:20:36.866 --> 00:20:38.408
We are men of our word.

237
00:20:38.491 --> 00:20:40.825
But look what has happened to our men.

238
00:20:40.866 --> 00:20:43.408
So our men count for nothing?

239
00:20:45.325 --> 00:20:47.491
- Selfishness.
- Who is selfish?

240
00:20:47.575 --> 00:20:48.991
- Zhang Fei!
- General!

241
00:20:51.658 --> 00:20:54.700
My Lord, the battle is set.

242
00:20:54.783 --> 00:20:56.366
- How can you...
- Zhu-ge Liang

243
00:20:59.991 --> 00:21:02.866
I have seen over a decade of defeat.

244
00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:05.241
I cannot endure another setback.

245
00:21:05.325 --> 00:21:10.991
Even soldiers must obey
the law of survival.

246
00:21:11.075 --> 00:21:13.241
We must not lose our allies' trust.

247
00:21:13.325 --> 00:21:15.366
I know you feel strongly.

248
00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:18.825
But in chaotic times,
you cannot live on justice alone.

249
00:21:18.866 --> 00:21:22.325
It's time I let others
fight the tough battles.

250
00:21:24.783 --> 00:21:28.658
One day you will understand this.

251
00:21:31.033 --> 00:21:32.533
Liu Bei.

252
00:21:35.450 --> 00:21:39.533
It was an honor to fight
alongside your men.

253
00:21:39.616 --> 00:21:42.491
We believed in the same goal.

254
00:21:42.533 --> 00:21:45.866
Achieving it will not be so easy after all.

255
00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:47.366
Take care.

256
00:21:48.616 --> 00:21:50.075
Take care.

257
00:22:03.491 --> 00:22:04.825
We shall meet again.

258
00:22:13.533 --> 00:22:14.825
Aren't you leaving?

259
00:22:18.366 --> 00:22:20.283
A man must honor his promises.

260
00:22:20.366 --> 00:22:23.783
If I start something, I see it to the end.

261
00:22:23.866 --> 00:22:26.950
Anyone who talks like that is insane.

262
00:22:28.533 --> 00:22:30.325
Then we are all insane.

263
00:22:50.783 --> 00:22:52.950
Your Highness, tea is ready.

264
00:22:59.366 --> 00:23:00.825
Brother, scouts report...

265
00:23:00.866 --> 00:23:02.450
...the typhoid was successful.

266
00:23:02.533 --> 00:23:04.741
The Southlands are in chaos.

267
00:23:05.700 --> 00:23:07.366
- Good.
- One more thing.

268
00:23:07.450 --> 00:23:09.825
Liu Bei has left with all his men.

269
00:23:09.908 --> 00:23:11.491
Good.

270
00:23:11.575 --> 00:23:13.491
Their alliance is broken.

271
00:23:15.908 --> 00:23:16.950
Excellent.

272
00:24:12.700 --> 00:24:14.658
Swift as the wind.

273
00:24:21.741 --> 00:24:23.866
Gentle as a forest.

274
00:24:35.450 --> 00:24:37.075
Fierce as fire.

275
00:24:47.325 --> 00:24:48.783
Firm as a mountain.

276
00:25:00.033 --> 00:25:01.658
If you hate war,

277
00:25:01.700 --> 00:25:03.741
...why can you quote "The Art of War"?

278
00:25:03.825 --> 00:25:05.783
To understand you,

279
00:25:05.866 --> 00:25:08.825
...I must sneak glances at your books.

280
00:25:10.075 --> 00:25:13.366
A thousand books cannot
equal a cup of your tea.

281
00:25:14.700 --> 00:25:17.075
I'm happy so long as you enjoy it.

282
00:25:20.033 --> 00:25:22.658
I wish we could invite Cao Cao for tea.

283
00:25:22.741 --> 00:25:25.700
Forget the war and just enjoy the scenery.

284
00:25:25.783 --> 00:25:27.491
Wouldn't that be great?

285
00:25:28.908 --> 00:25:31.366
I doubt he appreciates the art of tea.

286
00:25:33.825 --> 00:25:35.825
You wield your sword...

287
00:25:35.908 --> 00:25:38.783
...like you know a way to beat Cao Cao

288
00:25:39.825 --> 00:25:41.491
A way as mysterious as darkness.

289
00:25:42.825 --> 00:25:44.700
And as powerful as thunder.

290
00:25:48.533 --> 00:25:50.533
It is time for us to act.

291
00:26:05.408 --> 00:26:07.866
Greetings, Your Highness.

292
00:26:07.908 --> 00:26:11.616
How goes the naval training, Admirals?

293
00:26:11.700 --> 00:26:13.825
Very well, Your Highness.

294
00:26:13.866 --> 00:26:17.783
We're using iron beams to join the fleet.

295
00:26:17.866 --> 00:26:20.741
Our men are Northerners
and new to naval battle.

296
00:26:20.825 --> 00:26:24.283
Now our ships shall be
stable as solid ground.

297
00:26:24.366 --> 00:26:27.491
Not even a storm will make our men seasick.

298
00:26:28.366 --> 00:26:30.700
- Can they be separated?
- Of course.

299
00:26:31.616 --> 00:26:33.575
Men, separate the ships.

300
00:26:45.866 --> 00:26:48.325
Unlocking the iron beams
separates the ships.

301
00:26:48.408 --> 00:26:51.658
The fleet will move into pincer formation...

302
00:26:51.741 --> 00:26:52.825
...ready for battle.

303
00:26:52.866 --> 00:26:55.450
You truly are naval experts...

304
00:26:55.533 --> 00:26:57.366
...to invent this tactic.

305
00:26:57.450 --> 00:26:58.700
Thank you, Your Highness.

306
00:26:59.366 --> 00:27:02.491
- Jiang Gan.
- At your service, Your Highness.

307
00:27:02.575 --> 00:27:04.658
You grew up with Zhou Yu, right?

308
00:27:04.741 --> 00:27:07.783
Yes, we were childhood friends.

309
00:27:07.866 --> 00:27:10.200
Cross the river. Urge him to surrender.

310
00:27:10.283 --> 00:27:11.991
Surrender?

311
00:27:12.075 --> 00:27:15.283
Zhou Yu's loyalty to Sun Quan runs deep.

312
00:27:15.366 --> 00:27:16.616
I'm afraid he won't...

313
00:27:16.700 --> 00:27:17.825
The Southlands are falling apart.

314
00:27:17.908 --> 00:27:19.658
Liu Bei has fled.

315
00:27:19.741 --> 00:27:22.283
Now is the time to ask
Zhou Yu to surrender.

316
00:27:22.366 --> 00:27:23.866
Yes, Your Highness.

317
00:27:48.908 --> 00:27:51.491
Piggy. Scared you didn't I?

318
00:28:00.033 --> 00:28:01.533
These guys keep tailing me.

319
00:28:01.616 --> 00:28:03.825
How can I have any fun like this?

320
00:28:05.366 --> 00:28:08.450
You're battalion commander.

321
00:28:08.533 --> 00:28:10.491
They have to follow you.

322
00:28:14.366 --> 00:28:16.866
Listen up! Everyone go practice Cuju.

323
00:28:16.950 --> 00:28:18.450
Yes, sir!

324
00:28:23.533 --> 00:28:25.366
It worked!

325
00:28:25.450 --> 00:28:28.450
- Let's have some fun! Great
- Okay.

326
00:28:31.325 --> 00:28:33.950
- What should we play?
- Let's play...

327
00:28:34.033 --> 00:28:35.741
Let's play Ride High.

328
00:28:35.825 --> 00:28:37.783
OK. Come on.

329
00:28:41.033 --> 00:28:42.408
You really are heavy.

330
00:28:42.491 --> 00:28:44.366
Your mother gave you the right nickname.

331
00:28:47.533 --> 00:28:49.825
This isn't high enough. Let's go up there.

332
00:28:49.866 --> 00:28:51.450
Watch your balance.

333
00:28:52.408 --> 00:28:53.950
Be careful.

334
00:28:54.033 --> 00:28:55.950
This high enough for you?

335
00:28:56.033 --> 00:28:58.075
Yeah. Stay still.

336
00:29:06.825 --> 00:29:08.783
- That itches.
- Itches?

337
00:29:09.950 --> 00:29:11.658
Here, let me scratch it.

338
00:29:12.700 --> 00:29:14.325
Much better.

339
00:29:17.825 --> 00:29:18.783
Turn left.

340
00:29:18.866 --> 00:29:20.450
What's so interesting there?
It's just the fleet.

341
00:29:20.533 --> 00:29:21.991
Don't move.

342
00:29:27.616 --> 00:29:28.533
My Lord.

343
00:29:28.616 --> 00:29:32.616
Cao Cao has several
hundred thousand soldiers.

344
00:29:32.700 --> 00:29:34.950
We have only thirty thousand.

345
00:29:35.033 --> 00:29:37.950
We are totally outnumbered.

346
00:29:38.033 --> 00:29:40.450
How can we fight like this?

347
00:29:40.533 --> 00:29:43.283
This will decide the fate
of the Southlands.

348
00:29:43.366 --> 00:29:46.075
We must fight even if we cannot win.

349
00:29:48.033 --> 00:29:49.491
How many arrows do we have?

350
00:29:49.575 --> 00:29:51.783
Not even fifty thousand.

351
00:29:51.866 --> 00:29:55.366
Liu Bei took forty thousand when he fled.

352
00:29:56.741 --> 00:29:59.491
Without those arrows, we cannot fight.

353
00:29:59.575 --> 00:30:02.991
The arrows are my responsibility.

354
00:30:03.033 --> 00:30:06.616
As well they should be.
Your Lord took them.

355
00:30:06.700 --> 00:30:09.408
We need one hundred thousand arrows.

356
00:30:09.491 --> 00:30:12.283
You still think you can handle it?

357
00:30:12.366 --> 00:30:16.325
Fine, if I cannot come up
with one hundred thousand,

358
00:30:16.408 --> 00:30:18.325
...you may take my head.

359
00:30:19.491 --> 00:30:21.408
We only have food for ten days.

360
00:30:21.491 --> 00:30:23.825
I give you ten days' time.

361
00:30:23.866 --> 00:30:27.491
I don't need ten, just three.

362
00:30:27.575 --> 00:30:29.575
We soldiers do not joke.

363
00:30:31.366 --> 00:30:35.366
You said you'd eliminate
Admirals Cai Mao and Zhang Yun.

364
00:30:35.450 --> 00:30:37.283
If not, then what?

365
00:30:39.825 --> 00:30:41.491
You may have my head.

366
00:30:53.616 --> 00:30:57.575
By night, the Milky Way.
By day, snaking clouds.

367
00:31:06.741 --> 00:31:08.283
You were here all night.

368
00:31:08.366 --> 00:31:10.616
What are you up to?

369
00:31:10.700 --> 00:31:12.325
See for yourself.

370
00:31:12.408 --> 00:31:14.533
Wind and water converge here.

371
00:31:14.616 --> 00:31:15.866
The feng shui is excellent.

372
00:31:15.950 --> 00:31:17.741
Glad you're relaxed.

373
00:31:17.825 --> 00:31:19.908
You are worrying me to death.

374
00:31:19.991 --> 00:31:22.408
The twenty ships with crew...

375
00:31:22.491 --> 00:31:23.825
...you requested are ready

376
00:31:30.075 --> 00:31:31.950
There's only one day left.

377
00:31:32.033 --> 00:31:34.908
Where are the arrows?
You haven't made even one.

378
00:31:34.991 --> 00:31:36.616
You should be in a nervous sweat.

379
00:31:36.700 --> 00:31:38.450
My sweat is of no concern.

380
00:31:38.533 --> 00:31:41.533
But see if the tortoise is sweating.

381
00:31:43.866 --> 00:31:45.325
It is.

382
00:31:46.575 --> 00:31:50.283
As I predicted, fog is coming.

383
00:31:50.366 --> 00:31:51.616
What fog?

384
00:31:51.700 --> 00:31:53.491
The only fog here is around my head.

385
00:31:54.533 --> 00:31:56.366
What is this plan of yours?

386
00:31:56.450 --> 00:31:58.741
Nature's secrets cannot be revealed.

387
00:32:00.908 --> 00:32:06.325
Old cow plows the paddy's rows.

388
00:32:06.366 --> 00:32:11.408
Young calf munches on what grows.

389
00:32:11.491 --> 00:32:13.325
You really are something.

390
00:32:13.366 --> 00:32:17.450
Back then you were just
a kid who loved to sing.

391
00:32:17.533 --> 00:32:21.283
Who'd have guessed that kid
would be a Viceroy.

392
00:32:22.491 --> 00:32:27.241
Planting rice is the old man's chore.

393
00:32:27.325 --> 00:32:30.825
We were ten when you clubbed
that bandit from behind.

394
00:32:30.908 --> 00:32:33.825
He spun around and somehow
the club was in my hands.

395
00:32:33.866 --> 00:32:37.991
He gave me the beating of my life.

396
00:32:38.075 --> 00:32:43.950
In the sedan chair the young boy snores.

397
00:32:45.033 --> 00:32:47.491
To this day I still don't understand...

398
00:32:47.575 --> 00:32:49.491
...how that club got into my hand

399
00:32:49.533 --> 00:32:51.283
You're too slow.

400
00:32:59.366 --> 00:33:00.491
You remember that time?

401
00:33:00.533 --> 00:33:04.366
I wrote on the tutor's exam book
in your handwriting...

402
00:33:04.450 --> 00:33:06.658
..."Senile idiot!"

403
00:33:06.741 --> 00:33:08.200
That's right!

404
00:33:08.283 --> 00:33:11.658
He gave me twenty swats across my butt.

405
00:33:11.741 --> 00:33:14.241
Back in those days,

406
00:33:14.325 --> 00:33:15.950
...there was no prank we didn't pull.

407
00:33:16.033 --> 00:33:18.658
I can trick any man I meet.

408
00:33:18.741 --> 00:33:21.991
But with you, I always play the fool.

409
00:33:24.408 --> 00:33:25.741
Bring my sword!

410
00:33:31.700 --> 00:33:32.991
Marvelous!

411
00:34:01.533 --> 00:34:03.991
You are a fine sword dancer.

412
00:34:15.033 --> 00:34:16.783
Are you here as Cao Cao's emissary?

413
00:34:16.866 --> 00:34:18.491
Me?

414
00:34:19.700 --> 00:34:21.616
I can barely speak for myself.

415
00:34:21.700 --> 00:34:23.491
How could I speak for Cao Cao?

416
00:34:23.533 --> 00:34:25.200
I'm not as clever as you...

417
00:34:25.283 --> 00:34:27.741
...but I know what song you're singing.

418
00:34:27.825 --> 00:34:29.783
You do not give me enough credit.

419
00:34:29.866 --> 00:34:31.700
I'd never disrespect a talented
Southerner...

420
00:34:31.783 --> 00:34:33.950
...but to serve Cao Cao is wrong.

421
00:34:34.033 --> 00:34:36.491
You have your Lord and I have mine, but...

422
00:34:36.533 --> 00:34:38.408
No matter.

423
00:34:38.491 --> 00:34:39.741
A few days from now...

424
00:34:39.825 --> 00:34:42.533
...someone will lay Cao Cao's
head at my feet.

425
00:34:42.616 --> 00:34:44.075
You believe me?

426
00:34:45.658 --> 00:34:46.825
Yes, I do.

427
00:34:46.908 --> 00:34:48.825
Your Honor, urgent news!

428
00:34:48.908 --> 00:34:50.825
Can't you see I have a guest?

429
00:35:03.575 --> 00:35:05.783
I know we've no arrows.

430
00:35:05.866 --> 00:35:07.741
If Zhu-ge Liang fails to get more,

431
00:35:07.825 --> 00:35:08.825
...I'll have his head

432
00:35:08.908 --> 00:35:11.741
Maybe our friends
across the river can help.

433
00:35:11.825 --> 00:35:14.283
They have a more important mission.

434
00:35:14.366 --> 00:35:16.408
Admirals Cai Mao and Zhang Yun report...

435
00:35:16.491 --> 00:35:18.450
...Cao Cao's head cannot be taken just yet.

436
00:35:18.533 --> 00:35:19.533
I fear...

437
00:35:19.616 --> 00:35:20.991
Do not underestimate them.

438
00:35:21.033 --> 00:35:22.658
Here is their message.

439
00:35:27.700 --> 00:35:28.991
Excellent!

440
00:35:31.533 --> 00:35:32.825
Mr. Jiang.

441
00:35:34.575 --> 00:35:36.575
What are you doing here alone?

442
00:35:36.658 --> 00:35:38.991
Mrs. Zhou? Come sit inside.

443
00:35:39.075 --> 00:35:41.741
Xiao Qiao, bring more wine.

444
00:35:41.825 --> 00:35:43.616
Any more and you'll be drunk.

445
00:35:43.700 --> 00:35:46.325
Come on, we'll drink more upstairs.

446
00:35:47.658 --> 00:35:49.908
Drink more?
Why end a good time?

447
00:35:50.866 --> 00:35:56.658
I heard Cao Cao invaded the Southlands
all for your wife.

448
00:35:57.991 --> 00:35:59.325
Is that so?

449
00:35:59.408 --> 00:36:02.866
Cao Cao has a reputation
for stealing men's wives.

450
00:36:04.033 --> 00:36:06.325
You're drunk More wine.

451
00:36:06.408 --> 00:36:08.616
More? Where?

452
00:36:53.033 --> 00:36:54.825
"We surrendered to Cao Cao...

453
00:36:54.908 --> 00:36:58.200
...not for profit but out of desperation.

454
00:36:58.283 --> 00:37:01.950
We now have the Northerners
entrapped in camp.

455
00:37:02.033 --> 00:37:07.408
Soon we will deliver his decap...

456
00:37:07.491 --> 00:37:08.950
...his decapitated head.

457
00:37:09.033 --> 00:37:12.491
Further reports to come.

458
00:37:12.575 --> 00:37:13.866
Admiral Cai Mao. "

459
00:37:13.950 --> 00:37:15.658
What are you looking at?

460
00:37:18.366 --> 00:37:20.491
Just one of my tricks.

461
00:37:21.700 --> 00:37:24.325
You do love to play tricks on me.

462
00:37:25.658 --> 00:37:27.783
I'll trick you again...

463
00:37:29.700 --> 00:37:31.616
...and again.

464
00:37:34.866 --> 00:37:38.783
Not this time you won't.

465
00:38:42.741 --> 00:38:46.533
Scarecrow, you're more of
a man than that fellow.

466
00:38:46.616 --> 00:38:49.450
That fellow doesn't tell me a thing.

467
00:38:49.533 --> 00:38:52.241
You're a better drinking buddy.

468
00:38:52.325 --> 00:38:53.575
Cheers!

469
00:39:10.616 --> 00:39:11.658
Scarecrow.

470
00:39:11.741 --> 00:39:13.825
Why are we heading for the enemy camp?

471
00:39:13.866 --> 00:39:16.408
You're not surrendering, are you?

472
00:39:29.950 --> 00:39:34.616
The enemy! The enemy is approaching!

473
00:39:35.408 --> 00:39:36.700
Separate ships.

474
00:39:39.991 --> 00:39:42.450
Send the left flank to intercept the enemy!

475
00:39:52.908 --> 00:39:54.658
Faster!

476
00:40:03.866 --> 00:40:06.283
Scarecrow, stop drumming!

477
00:40:06.366 --> 00:40:08.825
What if Cao Cao's men come for us?

478
00:40:08.866 --> 00:40:10.241
They wouldn't dare.

479
00:40:10.325 --> 00:40:12.533
A heavy fog might hide an ambush.

480
00:40:12.616 --> 00:40:14.283
Oh, so you've decided to talk to me.

481
00:40:22.616 --> 00:40:23.991
Ready all archers!

482
00:40:24.950 --> 00:40:26.450
Shoot at first sight!

483
00:40:31.033 --> 00:40:32.366
Ready!

484
00:40:32.450 --> 00:40:34.658
All ships line up!

485
00:41:04.366 --> 00:41:06.741
This is a plot to turn us
against each other.

486
00:41:11.575 --> 00:41:13.241
We're not fools.

487
00:41:13.325 --> 00:41:17.283
Would Zhou Yu use such an obvious trick?

488
00:41:17.366 --> 00:41:20.241
Sometimes the simplest trick...

489
00:41:20.325 --> 00:41:22.658
...is the best way to lead
someone to their death.

490
00:41:29.075 --> 00:41:30.491
Shoot!

491
00:41:46.908 --> 00:41:48.325
Shoot.!

492
00:42:12.825 --> 00:42:16.325
Your Highness,
whether this is a trick or not,

493
00:42:16.408 --> 00:42:18.658
...we should proceed with caution.

494
00:42:18.741 --> 00:42:20.700
What if their navy mutinies?

495
00:42:20.741 --> 00:42:22.283
That would be a disaster.

496
00:42:23.700 --> 00:42:24.991
Shoot!

497
00:42:29.533 --> 00:42:30.866
Besides the letter,

498
00:42:30.950 --> 00:42:33.450
...I heard them mention...

499
00:42:33.533 --> 00:42:35.616
...friends here would get them arrows.

500
00:43:06.700 --> 00:43:07.866
Don't worry.

501
00:43:07.950 --> 00:43:09.950
Scarecrow will protect you.

502
00:43:21.408 --> 00:43:22.950
Cease drumming!

503
00:43:29.908 --> 00:43:33.283
Call Admirals Cai Mao and Zhang Yun
in for questioning.

504
00:43:33.366 --> 00:43:36.491
They are out training the fleet.

505
00:43:36.575 --> 00:43:40.325
If they are not here,
then their handwriting is.

506
00:43:40.366 --> 00:43:42.825
Bring their letter of surrender.

507
00:43:42.866 --> 00:43:45.616
Ready, all ships about-face!

508
00:43:45.700 --> 00:43:46.991
What?

509
00:44:04.283 --> 00:44:05.325
Drum in unison.

510
00:44:05.408 --> 00:44:07.491
Give them a target to shoot.

511
00:44:12.575 --> 00:44:14.616
Aim for the drums.

512
00:44:16.075 --> 00:44:17.491
Shoot!

513
00:44:21.866 --> 00:44:23.325
Drink up.

514
00:44:28.533 --> 00:44:29.950
Watch your seat.

515
00:44:35.825 --> 00:44:37.033
Fire at will!

516
00:44:56.366 --> 00:44:58.866
The handwriting is a perfect match...

517
00:44:58.908 --> 00:45:01.450
...and full of the same mistakes.

518
00:45:04.908 --> 00:45:06.741
This must be the work of Cai Mao.

519
00:45:06.825 --> 00:45:08.491
Shoot!

520
00:45:30.366 --> 00:45:31.825
We return home victorious!

521
00:45:33.491 --> 00:45:34.825
Cheers.

522
00:45:54.950 --> 00:45:57.866
Nothing but scared mice.
Return to your positions!

523
00:45:57.950 --> 00:46:03.783
Return to your positions!

524
00:46:03.866 --> 00:46:06.408
Thank you Prime Minister for your gift.

525
00:46:06.491 --> 00:46:09.408
Thank you...

526
00:46:37.325 --> 00:46:38.283
Marvelous!

527
00:46:38.366 --> 00:46:41.491
Mr. Zhu-ge! Look...

528
00:46:41.575 --> 00:46:44.825
How did you know the fog was coming?

529
00:46:44.908 --> 00:46:47.241
A clear Milky Way and snaking clouds...

530
00:46:47.325 --> 00:46:48.450
...signal fog is near.

531
00:46:48.533 --> 00:46:51.700
If you know how earth,
sky, yin and yang change,

532
00:46:51.783 --> 00:46:53.908
...then the sun, moon and stars;

533
00:46:53.991 --> 00:46:56.325
...the wind, forest, mountains and fire...

534
00:46:56.366 --> 00:46:58.491
...become soldiers at your command.

535
00:46:58.575 --> 00:47:01.450
So you can read
Mother Nature's moods, huh?

536
00:47:02.033 --> 00:47:03.866
We lost one!

537
00:47:03.950 --> 00:47:06.950
- What a shame...
- Hey, come back!

538
00:47:49.325 --> 00:47:52.325
A small victory hardly
deserves such a reception.

539
00:47:52.408 --> 00:47:55.366
Your Highness.
A small victory?

540
00:47:55.450 --> 00:47:57.241
How many men did the enemy send?

541
00:47:57.325 --> 00:47:59.616
Fog covered the river. Impossible to see.

542
00:47:59.700 --> 00:48:02.366
If you could not see,
how did you repel them?

543
00:48:02.450 --> 00:48:03.950
Firing at will forced retreat.

544
00:48:04.033 --> 00:48:06.950
Firing at will?
How many arrows is that?

545
00:48:08.450 --> 00:48:09.950
About one hundred thousand.

546
00:48:10.033 --> 00:48:11.450
About one hundred thousand!

547
00:48:12.366 --> 00:48:13.866
And why didn't you pursue them?

548
00:48:13.950 --> 00:48:16.200
Fog meant possible ambush, Your Highness.

549
00:48:16.283 --> 00:48:17.491
So...

550
00:48:17.575 --> 00:48:19.491
Again with the fog.

551
00:48:19.533 --> 00:48:24.783
Seems like you are hiding
something in that fog.

552
00:48:26.950 --> 00:48:28.991
Look, a boat is floating this way.

553
00:48:29.075 --> 00:48:30.825
Pull it in...

554
00:48:59.033 --> 00:49:00.616
Your Highness.

555
00:49:00.700 --> 00:49:03.825
Can't you tell a soldier from a scarecrow?

556
00:49:04.866 --> 00:49:07.783
One hundred thousand arrows?

557
00:49:07.866 --> 00:49:10.325
You're mighty generous.

558
00:49:10.408 --> 00:49:11.408
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

559
00:49:11.491 --> 00:49:12.616
I deserve death, Your Highness.

560
00:49:12.700 --> 00:49:14.491
Today it's arrows...

561
00:49:14.575 --> 00:49:17.950
Tomorrow it's my head, am I right?

562
00:49:26.450 --> 00:49:28.450
Zhou Yu is turning us against each other.

563
00:49:28.533 --> 00:49:31.366
No spy is stupid enough to...

564
00:49:31.450 --> 00:49:32.700
Silence!

565
00:49:34.075 --> 00:49:37.950
I trust and honor talented men.

566
00:49:38.033 --> 00:49:42.825
But I abhor deceivers and traitors.

567
00:49:42.866 --> 00:49:44.575
Guards!

568
00:49:45.283 --> 00:49:47.658
Your Highness,
we have trained day and night.

569
00:49:47.700 --> 00:49:49.658
Take them away and behead them.

570
00:49:49.741 --> 00:49:52.325
We swear our loyalty to Your Highness.

571
00:49:52.825 --> 00:49:55.325
Didn't I surrender to a benevolent ruler?

572
00:49:55.408 --> 00:49:56.325
We have trained night and day.

573
00:49:56.408 --> 00:49:57.533
Wait, Your Highness.

574
00:49:57.616 --> 00:50:01.325
If you kill them, who will lead the navy?

575
00:50:01.366 --> 00:50:02.658
Halt!

576
00:50:11.075 --> 00:50:13.366
Ninety-three thousand eight hundred.

577
00:50:13.450 --> 00:50:16.200
Ninety-four thousand.

578
00:50:16.283 --> 00:50:18.283
Ninety-four thousand two hundred.

579
00:50:18.366 --> 00:50:20.700
Ninety-four thousand six hundred.

580
00:50:20.783 --> 00:50:23.658
We'll shoot Cao Cao with his own arrows.

581
00:50:23.700 --> 00:50:25.700
This battle will be interesting.

582
00:50:31.408 --> 00:50:32.450
Concentrate! No mistakes.

583
00:50:32.533 --> 00:50:33.783
Wait.

584
00:50:33.866 --> 00:50:35.908
Don't interrupt!

585
00:50:35.991 --> 00:50:38.866
Two hundred per person.
There'll be no mistakes.

586
00:50:38.950 --> 00:50:41.283
Mr. Zhu-ge, what is this new invention?

587
00:50:41.366 --> 00:50:42.491
A rapid-fire crossbow.

588
00:50:42.533 --> 00:50:44.533
It shoots ten arrows without reloading.

589
00:50:44.616 --> 00:50:45.991
Here, watch.

590
00:50:46.033 --> 00:50:47.950
Great.

591
00:50:48.033 --> 00:50:49.533
Ninety-nine thousand four hundred.

592
00:50:49.616 --> 00:50:51.283
Ninety-nine thousand six hundred.

593
00:51:00.491 --> 00:51:01.575
Impressive!

594
00:51:01.658 --> 00:51:04.325
You know a trifle about weapon design too.

595
00:51:04.408 --> 00:51:07.825
Knowing a trifle about everything
gives life more color.

596
00:51:07.908 --> 00:51:10.450
Your Honor.

597
00:51:10.533 --> 00:51:12.616
Did he reach one hundred thousand?

598
00:51:12.700 --> 00:51:16.575
The total is
ninety-nine thousand six hundred.

599
00:51:18.033 --> 00:51:19.825
Now what?

600
00:51:20.783 --> 00:51:22.575
Well...

601
00:51:25.450 --> 00:51:27.825
Your Honor, it's only four hundred.

602
00:51:27.908 --> 00:51:29.950
Short one is still short.

603
00:51:30.033 --> 00:51:31.616
The law is firm as a mountain.

604
00:51:31.700 --> 00:51:35.325
That's right. So what does the law say?

605
00:51:39.783 --> 00:51:41.491
The law prescribes beheading.

606
00:51:42.950 --> 00:51:44.741
Garbages!

607
00:51:44.825 --> 00:51:46.283
What took you so long?

608
00:51:46.366 --> 00:51:47.741
Hurry and bring them over.

609
00:51:47.825 --> 00:51:49.325
Thank god!

610
00:51:49.408 --> 00:51:50.783
The total is
one hundred thousand two hundred.

611
00:51:50.866 --> 00:51:53.408
Mr. Zhu-ge has completed his mission.

612
00:51:53.491 --> 00:51:56.450
Seems like my head is safe where it is.

613
00:51:57.075 --> 00:51:58.825
How about yours?

614
00:52:01.991 --> 00:52:03.825
You want my head?

615
00:52:05.741 --> 00:52:07.908
Mr. Zhu-ge.
We're just joking.

616
00:52:07.991 --> 00:52:11.950
When I lost, was he joking?

617
00:52:12.033 --> 00:52:13.950
Of course not.

618
00:52:37.991 --> 00:52:39.866
Looks like you haven't lost after all.

619
00:52:39.950 --> 00:52:42.450
Cao Cao has executed
Admirals Cai Mao and Zhang Yun.

620
00:52:51.075 --> 00:52:54.491
I think we've been duped.

621
00:52:54.575 --> 00:52:57.741
Steal the enemy's weapons
then destroy their moral.

622
00:52:57.825 --> 00:53:00.991
Your strategies
worked together brilliantly.

623
00:53:03.491 --> 00:53:05.658
Cao Cao must be going crazy
right about now.

624
00:53:05.700 --> 00:53:08.741
In two or three days,
he will try something desperate.

625
00:53:08.825 --> 00:53:11.283
But this will not be good for Jiang Gan.

626
00:53:14.366 --> 00:53:15.908
I've lost an old friend.

627
00:53:19.075 --> 00:53:20.491
Honored guests...

628
00:53:20.575 --> 00:53:22.991
Zhou Yu is just showing off his cleverness.

629
00:53:23.033 --> 00:53:25.741
He undoubtedly thinks I have gone crazy.

630
00:53:25.825 --> 00:53:27.783
Tell me, do I look crazy?

631
00:53:27.866 --> 00:53:30.825
Not at all...

632
00:53:30.866 --> 00:53:32.616
Come, let us root out the traitor...

633
00:53:32.700 --> 00:53:34.991
...then we can sleep easy. Cheers!

634
00:53:36.783 --> 00:53:39.283
- Jiang Gan.
- Yes

635
00:53:39.366 --> 00:53:42.491
Today you were of great service.

636
00:53:42.533 --> 00:53:43.866
Please drink.

637
00:53:50.825 --> 00:53:52.283
Thank you, Your Highness.

638
00:54:03.741 --> 00:54:04.950
Sir!

639
00:54:10.866 --> 00:54:12.575
Sir! Are you...

640
00:54:16.908 --> 00:54:19.450
Your stupidity was trivial.

641
00:54:19.533 --> 00:54:21.825
But you brought your stupidity upon me.

642
00:54:26.866 --> 00:54:28.033
Hear this!

643
00:54:29.825 --> 00:54:32.658
In two days,
our army shall cross the river...

644
00:54:32.700 --> 00:54:33.783
...and take Red Cliff!

645
00:54:33.866 --> 00:54:34.991
Yes, Your Highness!

646
00:54:42.825 --> 00:54:47.325
All hear this!
In two days the army will cross the river.

647
00:55:03.658 --> 00:55:04.991
What's going on here?

648
00:55:07.866 --> 00:55:09.991
There's a spy! Catch the spy!

649
00:55:16.866 --> 00:55:18.075
Halt!

650
00:55:24.741 --> 00:55:26.408
Don't let him escape!

651
00:55:27.866 --> 00:55:29.325
Grab him!

652
00:55:49.741 --> 00:55:52.241
Piggy, why do they want to hurt you?

653
00:55:52.325 --> 00:55:54.866
It's a misunderstanding
A misunderstanding?

654
00:55:55.366 --> 00:55:56.450
What's going on?

655
00:55:56.533 --> 00:55:57.658
He's a spy.

656
00:55:57.741 --> 00:55:59.200
Nonsense, he is my friend.

657
00:55:59.283 --> 00:56:01.450
Friend? Are you stupid?

658
00:56:02.783 --> 00:56:04.533
Come on, they're beating up the commander.

659
00:56:04.616 --> 00:56:05.825
A fight!

660
00:56:33.408 --> 00:56:34.950
Pit.

661
00:56:35.741 --> 00:56:37.075
Pit.

662
00:56:41.783 --> 00:56:43.700
Piggy, are you all right?

663
00:56:49.033 --> 00:56:50.616
I have to go.

664
00:56:56.533 --> 00:56:58.741
Piggy!

665
00:56:58.825 --> 00:57:00.658
Where are you going?

666
00:57:00.700 --> 00:57:03.658
My mother is sick. I must go home.

667
00:57:03.741 --> 00:57:06.866
That's very kind of you to visit her.

668
00:57:12.366 --> 00:57:13.325
You should go home too.

669
00:57:13.408 --> 00:57:15.616
No, I'll return after the war.

670
00:57:15.700 --> 00:57:16.825
Fighting means no taxes.

671
00:57:16.866 --> 00:57:18.825
That means more food on the table.

672
00:57:18.866 --> 00:57:20.616
Hurry, go visit your mother.

673
00:57:27.866 --> 00:57:29.658
I will come back to see you.

674
00:57:37.575 --> 00:57:38.950
Ride high.

675
00:57:51.700 --> 00:57:53.325
Don't let him escape!

676
00:57:53.408 --> 00:57:55.075
He's just going to see his mother.

677
00:58:13.741 --> 00:58:14.866
In eighteen years of battle,

678
00:58:14.950 --> 00:58:17.366
...I have never lost

679
00:58:17.450 --> 00:58:20.450
If I fail to capture this tiny cliff,

680
00:58:20.533 --> 00:58:22.825
...I shudder to think
what historians will say.

681
00:58:22.908 --> 00:58:24.075
Yes.

682
00:58:29.700 --> 00:58:34.616
Your Highness.

683
00:58:45.533 --> 00:58:46.741
How are things?

684
00:58:47.575 --> 00:58:49.825
Worse than expected.

685
00:58:49.908 --> 00:58:53.450
The disease's spread has not slowed.

686
00:58:54.783 --> 00:58:55.991
At this rate,

687
00:58:56.075 --> 00:58:58.825
...it will take a month to control.

688
00:59:01.866 --> 00:59:04.825
I respectfully request you
delay the assault.

689
00:59:17.283 --> 00:59:18.991
Stop! Lie still

690
00:59:19.033 --> 00:59:21.366
- Your Highness.
- Sit up.

691
00:59:21.450 --> 00:59:24.283
You are ill and must recuperate.

692
00:59:27.325 --> 00:59:31.575
Man Tun, how can you be ill?

693
00:59:31.658 --> 00:59:33.575
You were always in perfect health.

694
00:59:34.783 --> 00:59:36.408
What is on your mind?

695
00:59:37.575 --> 00:59:39.408
Go ahead.

696
00:59:39.491 --> 00:59:41.033
I want to go home.

697
00:59:43.991 --> 00:59:45.783
I too have not been home for a long time.

698
00:59:47.325 --> 00:59:49.616
I want to see my youngest son.

699
00:59:53.991 --> 00:59:55.825
He is only thirteen.

700
00:59:57.991 --> 01:00:01.658
Younger than you even.

701
01:00:01.700 --> 01:00:05.241
He is kind-hearted and bright.

702
01:00:05.325 --> 01:00:10.783
He has been frail since birth
and is often sick.

703
01:00:10.866 --> 01:00:13.200
Yet in front of me,

704
01:00:13.283 --> 01:00:15.825
...he pretends everything is fine.

705
01:00:18.491 --> 01:00:22.325
Whatever the illness, he endures.

706
01:00:22.408 --> 01:00:24.033
He never complains to me...

707
01:00:46.075 --> 01:00:50.658
...I swore at the start of this war...

708
01:00:50.741 --> 01:00:54.783
...to cleanse the world of warlords.

709
01:01:00.700 --> 01:01:04.491
We must seize Red Cliff
and storm the capital.

710
01:01:07.283 --> 01:01:12.491
Then bring the mud of this land back home...

711
01:01:13.533 --> 01:01:17.325
...and tell our families we were victorious.

712
01:01:19.658 --> 01:01:21.408
We were victorious!

713
01:01:23.700 --> 01:01:27.700
So you all must be strong...

714
01:01:30.700 --> 01:01:34.033
...as must I...

715
01:01:35.533 --> 01:01:40.783
...because I must bring you back home.

716
01:02:25.325 --> 01:02:28.075
Victory...

717
01:03:42.408 --> 01:03:44.408
Greetings everyone.

718
01:03:44.491 --> 01:03:45.450
Sorry for the wait.

719
01:03:45.533 --> 01:03:46.825
We're glad you're back safe.

720
01:03:47.908 --> 01:03:49.616
Did you have any problems?

721
01:03:49.658 --> 01:03:51.741
No. I just fell into the mud.

722
01:03:51.825 --> 01:03:53.491
jumping the stockade.

723
01:03:54.533 --> 01:03:56.075
Shang Xiang.

724
01:03:57.283 --> 01:03:58.616
You're always causing trouble.

725
01:03:58.658 --> 01:04:00.616
Where have you been?

726
01:04:05.033 --> 01:04:07.075
They are ready to attack.

727
01:04:07.866 --> 01:04:09.408
Shang Xiang.

728
01:04:10.408 --> 01:04:11.491
You're back.

729
01:04:11.575 --> 01:04:13.491
Xiao Qiao.

730
01:04:17.075 --> 01:04:18.658
Shang Xiang?

731
01:04:31.283 --> 01:04:32.741
Xiao Qiao...

732
01:04:32.825 --> 01:04:35.658
...please help me pull this.
Go ahead, pull it.

733
01:05:05.408 --> 01:05:07.825
This is a map of Cao Cao's camp.

734
01:05:07.908 --> 01:05:09.533
This tower here...

735
01:05:09.616 --> 01:05:11.408
...is Cao Cao's headquarters.

736
01:05:11.491 --> 01:05:13.741
Their best troops guard it.

737
01:05:13.825 --> 01:05:15.241
The barracks are here.

738
01:05:15.325 --> 01:05:17.200
East and west are well-defended.

739
01:05:17.283 --> 01:05:18.908
The rear hill is weakest.

740
01:05:18.991 --> 01:05:21.366
It's like a tiger that stares ahead...

741
01:05:21.450 --> 01:05:22.700
...but forgets its tail.

742
01:05:22.783 --> 01:05:23.950
The navy is here Put this on.

743
01:05:24.033 --> 01:05:24.991
- You'll catch a chill.
- I'm not cold

744
01:05:25.075 --> 01:05:26.491
A third of their forces...

745
01:05:26.575 --> 01:05:28.658
...are onboard ready for assault.

746
01:05:28.741 --> 01:05:30.866
Warships lead the smaller boats.

747
01:05:30.950 --> 01:05:32.825
Transport ships are in the middle.

748
01:05:32.866 --> 01:05:34.450
This is an interlocked naval formation.

749
01:05:34.491 --> 01:05:35.658
I'm fine.

750
01:05:35.741 --> 01:05:37.825
Every ship is ready for attack or defense.

751
01:05:57.075 --> 01:05:58.991
I was wrong to scold you.

752
01:06:07.908 --> 01:06:09.450
If you were Zhou Yu,

753
01:06:09.533 --> 01:06:12.283
...how would you attack?

754
01:06:13.116 --> 01:06:15.283
He only has enough men for one assault...

755
01:06:15.366 --> 01:06:18.283
...an all-out attack on our fleet.

756
01:06:18.366 --> 01:06:21.283
They will want to attack with fire.

757
01:06:21.366 --> 01:06:23.491
Fire? I doubt it.

758
01:06:23.575 --> 01:06:26.283
Without manpower, they need strength.

759
01:06:26.366 --> 01:06:29.366
Where can they get it? Fire of course.

760
01:06:29.450 --> 01:06:31.450
This is a standard rule of war.

761
01:06:31.533 --> 01:06:33.991
Too bad it won't work.

762
01:06:34.075 --> 01:06:37.283
A northwest wind is blowing.

763
01:06:37.366 --> 01:06:40.575
If they attack our fleet with fire,

764
01:06:40.658 --> 01:06:45.991
...they will be fighting the wind
and burn themselves.

765
01:06:46.033 --> 01:06:49.116
We are the ones who should use fire.

766
01:06:49.200 --> 01:06:53.075
Yes, load the ships with brimstone.

767
01:06:53.158 --> 01:06:56.575
Tomorrow, we shall burn
Red Cliff to the ground!

768
01:07:04.116 --> 01:07:06.033
The map shows.

769
01:07:06.116 --> 01:07:08.491
Cao Cao's army has finished deployment.

770
01:07:08.575 --> 01:07:13.533
Tonight may be the decisive battle.

771
01:07:13.616 --> 01:07:16.325
This is a fight to the death.

772
01:07:16.366 --> 01:07:20.741
Win or lose, we must fight
with everything we have.

773
01:07:34.741 --> 01:07:36.158
Shang Xiang.

774
01:07:36.200 --> 01:07:38.200
What are these lines between the ships?

775
01:07:38.283 --> 01:07:39.658
It sounds funny.

776
01:07:39.700 --> 01:07:42.700
They've locked their boats together...

777
01:07:42.741 --> 01:07:44.491
...to stabilize the fleet...

778
01:07:44.533 --> 01:07:47.658
...so the Northerners won't get seasick.

779
01:07:47.741 --> 01:07:51.116
Enough talk. What is your strategy?

780
01:07:58.741 --> 01:08:01.533
Cao Cao made camp in a bad location.

781
01:08:01.616 --> 01:08:03.200
It is hook-shaped.

782
01:08:03.283 --> 01:08:05.283
This makes return difficult.

783
01:08:05.366 --> 01:08:09.658
If their assault fails,
they cannot fall back.

784
01:08:09.741 --> 01:08:11.533
We should use fire.

785
01:08:11.616 --> 01:08:13.783
The terrain is in our favor.

786
01:08:13.866 --> 01:08:16.991
If we can burn the fleet's vanguard,

787
01:08:17.075 --> 01:08:19.533
...they will be trapped and vulnerable.

788
01:08:19.616 --> 01:08:22.116
Yes, a fire attack!

789
01:08:22.200 --> 01:08:25.700
Just give me ten fire ships.

790
01:08:25.783 --> 01:08:29.075
Two will hit their left and right flanks.

791
01:08:29.158 --> 01:08:33.533
The remaining eight will ram the center.

792
01:08:33.616 --> 01:08:35.033
We'll burn an opening here!

793
01:08:35.116 --> 01:08:38.116
Next, you follow closely and rush in.

794
01:08:38.200 --> 01:08:41.450
No matter how great their numbers,

795
01:08:41.533 --> 01:08:43.575
...we will crush them.

796
01:08:49.450 --> 01:08:51.450
If only we still had Liu Bei's cavalry,

797
01:08:51.533 --> 01:08:54.408
...then we could attack
their camp at the rear.

798
01:08:54.491 --> 01:08:57.200
Then victory would be assured.

799
01:09:10.700 --> 01:09:13.116
This wind is to Cao Cao's advantage.

800
01:09:15.491 --> 01:09:17.450
A northwest wind is blowing.

801
01:09:17.533 --> 01:09:19.991
Sailing into the wind
will burn our own fleet.

802
01:09:20.033 --> 01:09:22.241
Cao Cao knows the wind is on his side.

803
01:09:22.325 --> 01:09:24.325
He will also think of using fire.

804
01:09:53.116 --> 01:09:54.616
Why are you so quiet?

805
01:09:54.700 --> 01:09:56.283
What are you looking at?

806
01:09:57.241 --> 01:09:59.991
Look, those dark clouds in the east...

807
01:10:00.033 --> 01:10:02.991
...are enshrouding the sun

808
01:10:03.033 --> 01:10:06.075
Isn't that rather unusual?

809
01:10:06.158 --> 01:10:08.491
Zhu-ge Liang, what does that mean?

810
01:10:08.575 --> 01:10:11.116
The winds will change.

811
01:10:14.116 --> 01:10:15.616
I know from farming.

812
01:10:15.700 --> 01:10:19.658
If during a warm winter clouds
enshroud the sun,

813
01:10:19.741 --> 01:10:22.366
...then along the Yangtze River...

814
01:10:22.450 --> 01:10:23.741
...an unseasonal wind will blow.

815
01:10:23.825 --> 01:10:25.575
What do you mean unseasonal?

816
01:10:25.658 --> 01:10:27.450
A warm southeast wind.

817
01:10:27.533 --> 01:10:30.658
It blows from southeast to northwest.

818
01:10:32.200 --> 01:10:34.658
What if Cao Cao knows this too?

819
01:10:34.700 --> 01:10:38.783
Only Admiral Cai Mao
would know and he is dead.

820
01:10:44.075 --> 01:10:45.450
Zhu-ge Liang.

821
01:10:45.533 --> 01:10:47.325
Can you predict when it will change?

822
01:10:47.408 --> 01:10:49.533
Tonight or tomorrow morning.

823
01:10:49.616 --> 01:10:52.741
History shows the timing of weather is key.

824
01:10:52.825 --> 01:10:54.575
He who can predict it will win.

825
01:11:01.366 --> 01:11:04.700
We must delay his attack.

826
01:11:04.783 --> 01:11:07.075
Only then will we have a chance at victory.

827
01:11:31.533 --> 01:11:33.366
Greetings, General.

828
01:11:40.158 --> 01:11:43.075
Terrific, just terrific
This fish oil is perfect!

829
01:12:11.700 --> 01:12:13.491
Bigger Yes, General!

830
01:12:25.450 --> 01:12:27.158
No good. Bigger!

831
01:12:27.241 --> 01:12:28.533
Yes, General.

832
01:12:38.700 --> 01:12:40.491
No good. Bigger!

833
01:12:40.533 --> 01:12:42.158
Just how big do you want it?

834
01:12:43.700 --> 01:12:45.325
Go.

835
01:13:01.533 --> 01:13:03.158
That's about right.

836
01:13:05.366 --> 01:13:07.450
Yes! This is it!

837
01:13:18.533 --> 01:13:21.491
See how strong this northwest wind is?

838
01:13:21.575 --> 01:13:23.366
It will never shift.

839
01:13:23.450 --> 01:13:25.825
We'll never get near their navy.

840
01:13:27.283 --> 01:13:30.075
Your Honor, I can fake a defection.

841
01:13:30.158 --> 01:13:31.616
Invent some excuse...

842
01:13:31.700 --> 01:13:33.491
...to punish me with fifty lashes.

843
01:13:33.575 --> 01:13:35.575
I'll fake a surrender in anger.

844
01:13:35.658 --> 01:13:38.700
That way Cao Cao is sure to believe me.

845
01:13:38.783 --> 01:13:42.658
Then I can sail my fire ships in range.

846
01:13:42.700 --> 01:13:46.075
How can you fight after such a beating?

847
01:13:47.366 --> 01:13:49.741
I could never treat a general that way.

848
01:13:50.741 --> 01:13:52.741
Do not lose heart.

849
01:13:52.825 --> 01:13:54.158
The east wind will come.

850
01:13:54.241 --> 01:13:55.658
Your Honor...

851
01:13:55.741 --> 01:13:57.658
Terrible news...

852
01:13:57.741 --> 01:14:00.533
Our Lady has disappeared!

853
01:14:24.200 --> 01:14:28.616
My dear husband,
by the time you read this,

854
01:14:28.700 --> 01:14:31.491
...I will be on the way to Cao Cao's camp.

855
01:14:33.700 --> 01:14:35.491
I will be cautious...

856
01:14:35.533 --> 01:14:38.200
...and only act when the moment is right.

857
01:14:40.033 --> 01:14:43.491
Yet I hope the east wind will come early.

858
01:14:43.533 --> 01:14:47.116
Where there is faith, there is hope.

859
01:14:51.783 --> 01:14:54.158
The clear waters of the Yangtze...

860
01:14:54.200 --> 01:14:57.033
...the emerald leaves of the mountains...

861
01:14:57.116 --> 01:14:59.575
...the birds returning to nest...

862
01:14:59.658 --> 01:15:01.825
...the fisherman singing his evening song.

863
01:15:03.825 --> 01:15:06.283
This is our home,

864
01:15:06.366 --> 01:15:08.450
...our beautiful native land.

865
01:15:10.033 --> 01:15:12.741
Our people gladly give
their lives for her sake.

866
01:15:14.450 --> 01:15:16.741
I cannot stand idly by.

867
01:15:41.000 --> 01:15:44.458
I have been carrying our child
Ping An for three months.

868
01:15:44.541 --> 01:15:46.625
I did not tell you...

869
01:15:47.583 --> 01:15:49.291
...fearing it might distract you.

870
01:15:51.083 --> 01:15:56.416
We cannot in caring for our child...

871
01:15:56.500 --> 01:15:58.625
...and forget the children of
the Southlands.

872
01:16:00.375 --> 01:16:03.500
I want to see them grow up together...

873
01:16:03.583 --> 01:16:07.666
...to have a future where they can play,

874
01:16:07.750 --> 01:16:11.458
...swim, pick flowers...

875
01:16:11.541 --> 01:16:13.458
...and plant rice in peace.

876
01:16:13.541 --> 01:16:16.916
"Your child Ping An "

877
01:16:16.958 --> 01:16:20.750
"Pregnant "

878
01:16:21.666 --> 01:16:25.208
"Do not fear...

879
01:16:25.250 --> 01:16:27.750
...I shall bring Ping An home. "

880
01:17:06.208 --> 01:17:09.416
Some traditions still carry great meaning.

881
01:17:09.458 --> 01:17:12.583
For example, rice flour and sugar...

882
01:17:12.666 --> 01:17:16.750
...stick together like a family at reunion.

883
01:17:25.541 --> 01:17:27.916
Over here! Bring the cart here!

884
01:17:27.958 --> 01:17:30.708
There are sweet rice
dumplings for everyone.

885
01:17:31.625 --> 01:17:34.291
Today is winter solstice,
a time for reunion.

886
01:17:34.375 --> 01:17:36.250
Everyone have some rice dumplings.

887
01:17:37.416 --> 01:17:40.250
Two or three per person! Eat up!

888
01:17:42.666 --> 01:17:44.375
Officers and soldiers alike, come on!

889
01:17:44.416 --> 01:17:47.291
Two or three per person! Eat up!

890
01:17:47.375 --> 01:17:49.125
Come on...

891
01:17:50.125 --> 01:17:51.541
Give me a bowl

892
01:18:06.750 --> 01:18:09.500
Zhang Fei, you're making them too big.

893
01:18:09.583 --> 01:18:12.041
Do you want us to choke?

894
01:18:12.083 --> 01:18:14.708
Fine with me. I couldn't be happier.

895
01:19:21.958 --> 01:19:23.666
Zhao Yun.

896
01:19:23.750 --> 01:19:26.583
Has your wound healed
from combat practice?

897
01:19:26.625 --> 01:19:30.666
So long as I can fight,
a wound means nothing.

898
01:19:45.041 --> 01:19:49.208
Guan Yu, how many times
have you read the classics?

899
01:19:49.250 --> 01:19:52.375
If a man of learning does not
understand brotherhood,

900
01:19:52.458 --> 01:19:54.250
...isn't his learning worthless?

901
01:20:16.416 --> 01:20:20.666
My Lord, what are we doing here?

902
01:20:20.750 --> 01:20:22.083
Waiting.

903
01:20:23.416 --> 01:20:25.291
Waiting for what?

904
01:20:25.375 --> 01:20:27.375
Waiting for Zhu-ge Liang.

905
01:20:27.416 --> 01:20:31.375
Waiting for his return, so we can go home.

906
01:20:31.416 --> 01:20:33.041
Do we still have a home?

907
01:20:34.333 --> 01:20:38.000
Sons of the Southlands, listen.

908
01:20:38.083 --> 01:20:40.875
Today is the winter solstice,

909
01:20:40.916 --> 01:20:44.416
...a day for family reunion.

910
01:20:44.500 --> 01:20:49.083
Yet thieves encircle our home.

911
01:20:49.166 --> 01:20:52.208
How can we celebrate like this?

912
01:20:52.250 --> 01:20:56.291
I say let us drive them from this land!

913
01:20:56.375 --> 01:20:59.208
Then we shall have
our celebratory family meal.

914
01:20:59.250 --> 01:21:02.250
Here!

915
01:21:05.916 --> 01:21:07.333
My Lord.

916
01:21:07.416 --> 01:21:09.166
Though I sometimes disagree with you,

917
01:21:09.250 --> 01:21:13.250
...I have never said a word against you.

918
01:21:13.333 --> 01:21:17.958
But this is a choice
between right and wrong.

919
01:21:18.041 --> 01:21:19.958
I acted for the good of us all...

920
01:21:20.041 --> 01:21:23.083
...yet you lecture me for being unrighteous

921
01:21:23.166 --> 01:21:26.166
You have followed me so long and for what?

922
01:21:26.250 --> 01:21:28.333
I just want to ensure we live on.

923
01:21:52.250 --> 01:21:56.000
There are some things I value
more than my life.

924
01:22:59.625 --> 01:23:04.875
Zhou Yu, may your plans come to fruition.

925
01:23:04.916 --> 01:23:07.125
We will fight the good fight.

926
01:23:30.250 --> 01:23:31.583
Zhou Yu's wife is here.

927
01:23:31.625 --> 01:23:33.458
She came alone.

928
01:25:31.208 --> 01:25:33.125
Zhou Yu,

929
01:25:33.208 --> 01:25:36.375
...we must alter our plan of attack

930
01:25:36.416 --> 01:25:38.291
Consider your wife's safety,

931
01:25:38.375 --> 01:25:40.083
...I will send our best men...

932
01:25:40.166 --> 01:25:43.083
...around back to rescue her.

933
01:25:43.166 --> 01:25:45.333
No changes.

934
01:25:45.416 --> 01:25:49.041
All our forces must be
focused on frontal assault.

935
01:25:49.125 --> 01:25:50.708
We cannot divide our strength.

936
01:25:52.125 --> 01:25:55.625
Your Honor, we stand
alone on the battlefield.

937
01:25:55.708 --> 01:25:57.375
Without allied support,

938
01:25:57.416 --> 01:26:00.916
...the chance for victory seems slight.

939
01:26:01.000 --> 01:26:03.416
I have never given up on my dream.

940
01:26:03.500 --> 01:26:06.125
Victory cannot rest on dreams alone.

941
01:26:12.333 --> 01:26:14.000
When will the east wind come?

942
01:26:14.083 --> 01:26:17.000
Based on new observations,

943
01:26:17.083 --> 01:26:18.541
...at around one o'clock.

944
01:26:18.625 --> 01:26:21.208
If at that time you
still trust your friends,

945
01:26:21.291 --> 01:26:23.375
...light a lantern for a signal.

946
01:26:28.166 --> 01:26:31.041
If misfortune befalls Xiao Qiao,

947
01:26:31.083 --> 01:26:33.416
...will you still fight a war of honor?

948
01:26:51.458 --> 01:26:54.333
I saw you once in the back
of your family's estate

949
01:26:54.416 --> 01:26:59.041
Though young, you were
already a great beauty

950
01:26:59.125 --> 01:27:00.875
You were studying the tea ceremony...

951
01:27:00.916 --> 01:27:03.541
...and liked catching butterflies.

952
01:27:22.458 --> 01:27:25.250
Did you launch this war for me?

953
01:27:25.333 --> 01:27:27.250
You believe that?

954
01:27:28.333 --> 01:27:31.375
My father was very fond of you.

955
01:27:31.416 --> 01:27:34.583
At that time, Cao Cao
believed in justice, ideals...

956
01:27:34.666 --> 01:27:36.583
...and loyalty to the Han throne.

957
01:27:36.666 --> 01:27:38.916
He was a young hero.

958
01:27:40.500 --> 01:27:45.625
How else could he have
become Prime Minister?

959
01:27:45.708 --> 01:27:49.000
By killing many people.

960
01:27:53.708 --> 01:27:57.583
I heard many Southland soldiers
have fallen ill.

961
01:27:57.625 --> 01:27:59.666
Yes.

962
01:27:59.750 --> 01:28:02.000
I heard Liu Bei has fled...

963
01:28:02.083 --> 01:28:04.666
...and the alliance is broken.

964
01:28:04.750 --> 01:28:07.083
Yes.

965
01:28:07.166 --> 01:28:11.083
Then Zhou Yu must be a lonely man.

966
01:28:18.500 --> 01:28:20.166
Did he send you?

967
01:28:20.250 --> 01:28:22.083
This was my idea.

968
01:28:25.250 --> 01:28:27.583
Why are you here?

969
01:28:27.625 --> 01:28:29.458
Please withdraw your troops.

970
01:28:30.958 --> 01:28:33.041
Victory is yours.

971
01:28:33.083 --> 01:28:35.000
What need is there to fight on?

972
01:28:35.083 --> 01:28:36.916
No.

973
01:28:37.000 --> 01:28:40.750
Zhou Yu shall kneel before me in surrender.

974
01:28:45.166 --> 01:28:47.083
What is this?

975
01:28:49.458 --> 01:28:51.625
I am not here for my husband...

976
01:28:51.708 --> 01:28:54.375
...but for the people of this kingdom.

977
01:28:54.416 --> 01:28:58.625
Please end this war.

978
01:28:58.708 --> 01:29:01.208
And if I refuse?

979
01:29:09.208 --> 01:29:10.666
Stop playing.

980
01:29:17.541 --> 01:29:21.208
You must witness how I defeat Zhou Yu.

981
01:30:04.208 --> 01:30:05.583
What's on your mind?

982
01:30:09.416 --> 01:30:11.541
Just thinking of a silly friend.

983
01:30:27.666 --> 01:30:31.083
The times make the hero.

984
01:31:02.166 --> 01:31:05.041
After this battle,

985
01:31:05.083 --> 01:31:06.625
...I will have time to savor your tea.

986
01:31:06.708 --> 01:31:09.375
Just one cup?

987
01:31:09.416 --> 01:31:11.083
It'll help you relax.

988
01:31:15.750 --> 01:31:17.333
Fine.

989
01:31:21.958 --> 01:31:25.333
No one's ever given us respect.

990
01:31:25.416 --> 01:31:27.250
So what?

991
01:31:27.291 --> 01:31:29.250
Who cares so long as we respect ourselves?

992
01:31:29.291 --> 01:31:30.875
Listen up!

993
01:31:30.958 --> 01:31:35.958
Our boats will soon charge Cao Cao's fleet.

994
01:31:36.041 --> 01:31:40.041
No man jumps ship until their ships burn.

995
01:31:40.083 --> 01:31:41.875
Yes, sir!

996
01:31:41.916 --> 01:31:43.125
Any problem with that?

997
01:31:43.208 --> 01:31:44.625
No, sir!

998
01:31:44.708 --> 01:31:46.375
That's what I thought.

999
01:31:46.416 --> 01:31:49.583
Have you all written to your families?

1000
01:31:49.666 --> 01:31:51.458
Yes.

1001
01:32:26.083 --> 01:32:27.125
Don't rush.

1002
01:32:27.208 --> 01:32:30.041
Appreciate the tea's color and bouquet.

1003
01:32:30.083 --> 01:32:31.333
Oh.

1004
01:32:55.041 --> 01:32:56.541
Why is the Prime Minister
waiting to attack?

1005
01:32:56.583 --> 01:32:57.916
The wind is behaving strangely.

1006
01:32:57.958 --> 01:33:00.041
I know.

1007
01:33:00.125 --> 01:33:01.875
He is drinking tea with that woman.

1008
01:33:01.916 --> 01:33:03.250
Tea?

1009
01:33:05.208 --> 01:33:08.083
What makes brewing tea so difficult?

1010
01:33:08.166 --> 01:33:13.000
Leaves, heat, water, and utensils...

1011
01:33:13.083 --> 01:33:14.916
...all demand study.

1012
01:33:20.000 --> 01:33:21.541
Yet the hardest is boiling water.

1013
01:33:23.000 --> 01:33:24.291
Boiling water?

1014
01:33:26.500 --> 01:33:27.750
Look!

1015
01:33:29.208 --> 01:33:30.625
The wind has stopped.

1016
01:33:41.583 --> 01:33:45.041
At first boil, bubbles hiss
and resemble tiny fish eyes.

1017
01:33:45.125 --> 01:33:49.333
At second boil,
the edge simmers like a fountain.

1018
01:33:49.416 --> 01:33:52.041
This is when tea is finest.

1019
01:33:52.125 --> 01:33:54.916
At third boil,
the water seethes and spurts.

1020
01:33:55.000 --> 01:33:58.916
Any further and the water
is past its prime.

1021
01:34:00.750 --> 01:34:03.666
Your Honor, the wind seems about to shift.

1022
01:34:03.750 --> 01:34:06.250
It's time to attack
What are we waiting for?

1023
01:34:06.333 --> 01:34:07.625
Our allies.

1024
01:34:07.708 --> 01:34:09.500
What allies?

1025
01:34:14.708 --> 01:34:16.208
Liu Bei fled days ago.

1026
01:34:16.291 --> 01:34:18.625
This is all part of Zhou Yu's plan.

1027
01:34:18.708 --> 01:34:21.375
Some plans are best kept quiet.

1028
01:34:26.125 --> 01:34:27.416
Enough! It is full!

1029
01:34:27.500 --> 01:34:29.416
Your Highness...

1030
01:34:29.458 --> 01:34:33.333
...don't you see your true self
reflected in this tea?

1031
01:34:33.416 --> 01:34:36.208
Your heart is overflowing with ambition.

1032
01:34:36.250 --> 01:34:41.666
It's too full to let other people in.

1033
01:34:41.750 --> 01:34:44.916
You've carried this
full heart to Red Cliff.

1034
01:34:45.000 --> 01:34:48.583
Someone here shall pour
that heart onto the floor.

1035
01:35:07.708 --> 01:35:09.666
Your Highness.

1036
01:35:09.750 --> 01:35:12.125
You do not understand the art of tea.

1037
01:35:20.041 --> 01:35:22.958
Your Honor, tell us what we must do.

1038
01:35:23.041 --> 01:35:24.166
At two o'clock,

1039
01:35:24.250 --> 01:35:27.375
...the ten fire ships
will ram Cao Cao's fleet...

1040
01:35:27.416 --> 01:35:29.125
...burning through their vanguard.

1041
01:35:31.375 --> 01:35:32.500
With the fleet broken,

1042
01:35:32.583 --> 01:35:35.375
...Zhao Yun will hit the east gate...

1043
01:35:35.416 --> 01:35:37.500
...to divert their attention.

1044
01:35:40.250 --> 01:35:42.958
Liu Bei, Guan Yu, and Zhang Fei...

1045
01:35:43.041 --> 01:35:45.500
...will overwhelm Cao Cao's camp
from the west gate.

1046
01:35:58.583 --> 01:36:00.041
Doctor!

1047
01:36:02.333 --> 01:36:03.458
Your Highness!

1048
01:36:03.541 --> 01:36:05.500
Call Doctor Hua Tuo. My head aches.

1049
01:36:05.583 --> 01:36:09.625
Your Highness, Hua Tuo has left.

1050
01:36:09.708 --> 01:36:13.208
- What did you say?
- Hua Tuo is gone.

1051
01:37:19.250 --> 01:37:20.958
Cast off!

1052
01:37:32.250 --> 01:37:33.250
What is this wind?

1053
01:37:33.333 --> 01:37:35.000
It's an easterly wind, Your Highness.

1054
01:37:35.083 --> 01:37:37.458
It shifted? Impossible!

1055
01:37:43.166 --> 01:37:44.958
Enemy ships approaching!

1056
01:37:45.625 --> 01:37:47.500
General, enemy ships approaching!

1057
01:37:47.583 --> 01:37:48.666
Hurry, separate the ships!

1058
01:37:48.750 --> 01:37:50.208
Separate ships!

1059
01:38:01.916 --> 01:38:03.000
What is that?

1060
01:38:03.083 --> 01:38:05.333
That is their lanterns, Your Highness.

1061
01:38:08.416 --> 01:38:09.708
Forward.

1062
01:38:16.625 --> 01:38:20.250
- Zhou Yu.
- I have done all I can.

1063
01:38:20.333 --> 01:38:22.708
Tonight will decide the fate of the empire.

1064
01:38:28.208 --> 01:38:29.875
There must be no mistakes.

1065
01:38:29.916 --> 01:38:31.541
Zhu-ge Liang,

1066
01:38:31.625 --> 01:38:34.000
...you weren't lying after all!

1067
01:38:41.500 --> 01:38:42.416
Report!

1068
01:38:42.500 --> 01:38:44.083
Boats are approaching fast.

1069
01:38:44.166 --> 01:38:45.083
Separate ships immediately.

1070
01:38:45.166 --> 01:38:46.666
Separation has already begun.

1071
01:38:59.625 --> 01:39:01.708
Light the fires!

1072
01:39:08.916 --> 01:39:10.333
Forward.

1073
01:39:20.041 --> 01:39:22.166
Hurry over here!

1074
01:39:47.666 --> 01:39:49.375
All speed ahead!

1075
01:40:36.083 --> 01:40:37.375
Hurry, separate the ships.

1076
01:40:39.375 --> 01:40:40.916
Faster.

1077
01:41:40.375 --> 01:41:42.958
Retreat! Protect the main gate!

1078
01:41:44.041 --> 01:41:49.750
Faster, toward Cao Cao's flagship!

1079
01:43:37.250 --> 01:43:38.708
Strike as powerful as thunder.

1080
01:44:15.041 --> 01:44:16.375
Charge!

1081
01:44:18.041 --> 01:44:20.333
Go ahead. Charge!

1082
01:44:41.666 --> 01:44:43.208
Follow me.

1083
01:45:05.708 --> 01:45:07.416
Shoot!

1084
01:45:20.708 --> 01:45:22.250
Launch catapults!

1085
01:45:38.166 --> 01:45:39.916
Hurry, the enemy is approaching

1086
01:45:40.000 --> 01:45:41.625
Look, over there.

1087
01:46:03.583 --> 01:46:05.500
Your Highness! Terrible news!

1088
01:46:05.583 --> 01:46:07.041
They have broken through the stockade!

1089
01:46:07.083 --> 01:46:08.583
Why are you panicking?

1090
01:46:10.125 --> 01:46:12.208
Do not forget you are a general.

1091
01:46:12.291 --> 01:46:13.750
I...

1092
01:47:22.083 --> 01:47:23.375
Try to endure the pain!

1093
01:47:40.250 --> 01:47:42.208
Reinforce Zhang Fei! Move!

1094
01:48:06.333 --> 01:48:10.041
Your Highness, the rear gate
is under surprise attack.

1095
01:48:10.125 --> 01:48:12.041
It is Liu Bei's allied forces.

1096
01:48:13.083 --> 01:48:14.708
Liu Bei?

1097
01:48:16.125 --> 01:48:17.958
Free the horses!

1098
01:48:18.041 --> 01:48:19.375
Pull!

1099
01:48:32.583 --> 01:48:33.916
Shoot!

1100
01:48:35.500 --> 01:48:36.541
General Gan,

1101
01:48:36.625 --> 01:48:38.958
...we must save energy for inside.

1102
01:48:42.416 --> 01:48:43.583
You must break down this gate...

1103
01:48:43.666 --> 01:48:45.208
...so we can join our allies...

1104
01:48:45.250 --> 01:48:46.375
...otherwise all is lost.

1105
01:48:46.458 --> 01:48:48.458
- No problem.
- Good luck

1106
01:49:20.041 --> 01:49:21.333
Halt!

1107
01:49:24.416 --> 01:49:26.083
Tear down the barricade!

1108
01:49:29.541 --> 01:49:31.041
Shoot!

1109
01:49:52.291 --> 01:49:53.541
Forward.

1110
01:49:53.625 --> 01:49:55.416
Attack the main gate.

1111
01:50:12.541 --> 01:50:13.916
Come on soldier!

1112
01:50:15.375 --> 01:50:16.666
Hang in there.

1113
01:50:27.166 --> 01:50:28.208
General Gan!

1114
01:50:28.250 --> 01:50:30.083
Individual bombs aren't strong enough.

1115
01:50:32.083 --> 01:50:34.333
Run! The fire is coming!

1116
01:50:34.416 --> 01:50:36.458
Give me all your fire bombs.

1117
01:50:36.541 --> 01:50:37.541
There's only three left.

1118
01:50:37.625 --> 01:50:40.916
No retreat! No surrender!

1119
01:50:57.125 --> 01:50:59.208
This is it!

1120
01:51:21.583 --> 01:51:23.416
All forces attack!

1121
01:52:31.250 --> 01:52:32.458
Shoot!

1122
01:53:50.583 --> 01:53:51.875
Your Highness.

1123
01:53:51.916 --> 01:53:53.416
The navy is lost.

1124
01:53:53.458 --> 01:53:56.500
East, south, and west...
all three sides have been sunk.

1125
01:54:05.041 --> 01:54:09.416
It seems like they went up in flames too.

1126
01:54:09.500 --> 01:54:11.375
Yes, Your Highness.

1127
01:54:11.416 --> 01:54:13.416
All is quiet below.

1128
01:54:27.916 --> 01:54:29.458
The fire is too fierce!

1129
01:54:29.541 --> 01:54:31.000
Stay together at all costs!

1130
01:54:31.083 --> 01:54:32.541
Don't get separated!

1131
01:54:41.666 --> 01:54:43.083
Your Highness.

1132
01:54:44.458 --> 01:54:46.500
Perhaps retreat is best.

1133
01:54:46.583 --> 01:54:48.250
Retreat?

1134
01:54:48.333 --> 01:54:50.875
With our best soldiers still remaining?

1135
01:54:50.916 --> 01:54:53.041
They would give their lives for me.

1136
01:54:56.125 --> 01:54:58.625
Even if all would die, they must fight.

1137
01:54:58.708 --> 01:55:00.541
This is military power.

1138
01:55:07.250 --> 01:55:09.583
All together! Charge!

1139
01:55:20.291 --> 01:55:21.458
Fight me if you dare.

1140
01:55:21.541 --> 01:55:23.208
Come back here!

1141
01:55:28.000 --> 01:55:29.916
Come on, you traitor!

1142
01:55:43.458 --> 01:55:44.958
General!

1143
01:56:32.541 --> 01:56:34.625
Don't give up, my brother.

1144
01:56:34.708 --> 01:56:37.458
Guan Yu! Where is Liu Bei?

1145
01:56:47.583 --> 01:56:49.291
All speed ahead!

1146
01:57:03.458 --> 01:57:05.041
Break formation!

1147
01:58:02.208 --> 01:58:03.583
Launch spears!

1148
01:58:14.416 --> 01:58:16.041
Forward!

1149
01:58:16.083 --> 01:58:19.541
Crush them or die trying!

1150
01:58:30.958 --> 01:58:32.583
Hang in there.

1151
01:59:57.166 --> 02:00:02.916
I oversaw the end of every warlord.

1152
02:00:12.041 --> 02:00:17.208
I saw the end of one here and one there.

1153
02:00:33.708 --> 02:00:35.666
The end of all but here...

1154
02:00:54.416 --> 02:00:55.666
Just in time.

1155
02:00:55.750 --> 02:00:57.583
I knew you wouldn't let me down.

1156
02:00:57.666 --> 02:00:59.500
I said we would meet again.

1157
02:00:59.583 --> 02:01:01.458
Gan Xing sacrificed himself.

1158
02:01:03.083 --> 02:01:04.708
But not in vain.

1159
02:01:07.958 --> 02:01:09.500
The fire is approaching!

1160
02:01:09.583 --> 02:01:11.541
We must save Xiao Qiao now!

1161
02:01:11.625 --> 02:01:13.333
First find Cao Cao.

1162
02:01:17.375 --> 02:01:20.250
We have lost...

1163
02:01:20.291 --> 02:01:22.916
...all because of that accursed woman.

1164
02:01:24.250 --> 02:01:27.541
She ruined our chance to attack.

1165
02:01:27.583 --> 02:01:29.083
I'll kill her.

1166
02:01:29.166 --> 02:01:30.458
Kill her.

1167
02:01:51.083 --> 02:01:53.166
Come no further.

1168
02:02:27.916 --> 02:02:29.416
Don't let the enemy through.

1169
02:02:29.458 --> 02:02:31.666
That way, quickly...

1170
02:02:37.416 --> 02:02:39.500
Protect the Prime Minister! Get them!

1171
02:02:39.583 --> 02:02:41.250
Pit?

1172
02:02:55.500 --> 02:02:57.041
Pit!

1173
02:03:02.083 --> 02:03:03.458
It's me, Piggy.

1174
02:03:06.666 --> 02:03:09.083
It's me, Piggy.

1175
02:03:09.166 --> 02:03:10.958
Piggy?

1176
02:03:43.666 --> 02:03:45.375
Piggy.

1177
02:03:48.500 --> 02:03:50.416
You came to see me.

1178
02:03:53.916 --> 02:03:56.208
I said I would.

1179
02:03:56.250 --> 02:03:58.083
Piggy...

1180
02:04:01.500 --> 02:04:05.333
Still want to play Ride High?

1181
02:06:22.041 --> 02:06:23.916
I'll kill that witch.

1182
02:07:26.250 --> 02:07:27.458
Don't move!

1183
02:07:37.416 --> 02:07:39.125
Zhou Yu.

1184
02:07:39.208 --> 02:07:40.583
Viceroy Zhou.

1185
02:07:40.666 --> 02:07:42.916
The traitor Cao Cao Silence!

1186
02:07:43.000 --> 02:07:45.208
You shall call me Prime Minister.

1187
02:07:47.458 --> 02:07:52.500
I never guessed I'd lose to a gust of wind.

1188
02:07:52.583 --> 02:07:54.583
Because you don't understand
the Will of Heaven.

1189
02:07:54.666 --> 02:07:59.583
I never dreamed I'd be
defeated by a cup of tea.

1190
02:08:02.041 --> 02:08:05.125
For you, war was just a tea ceremony.

1191
02:08:05.208 --> 02:08:06.916
Such a pity!

1192
02:08:07.000 --> 02:08:08.625
You never knew what you were fighting for!

1193
02:08:08.708 --> 02:08:11.041
I come by order of the Emperor...

1194
02:08:11.083 --> 02:08:14.083
...to subdue rebels like you.

1195
02:08:15.416 --> 02:08:17.291
We are not rebelling against the Emperor...

1196
02:08:17.375 --> 02:08:19.625
- ... but against you.
- You pest!

1197
02:08:56.208 --> 02:08:57.958
Little boy...

1198
02:08:58.041 --> 02:09:00.250
This has been quite an enjoyable hunt.

1199
02:09:01.708 --> 02:09:03.541
What do you want to hunt?

1200
02:09:03.583 --> 02:09:05.666
Tiger.

1201
02:09:05.750 --> 02:09:08.916
By the looks of you.

1202
02:09:09.000 --> 02:09:11.916
You are a far cry from your father.

1203
02:09:16.416 --> 02:09:17.958
Shoot!

1204
02:09:27.583 --> 02:09:30.500
I am prime Minister of the Emperor's court.

1205
02:09:30.583 --> 02:09:34.041
Death is too good for rebels like you.

1206
02:09:34.083 --> 02:09:36.083
If you declare allegiance to me,

1207
02:09:36.125 --> 02:09:38.458
...I can pardon you.

1208
02:09:42.375 --> 02:09:44.583
Kneel down, all of you.

1209
02:09:49.083 --> 02:09:50.583
Your time is over.

1210
02:10:03.625 --> 02:10:05.375
Lay down your sword.

1211
02:10:16.333 --> 02:10:18.291
Your Highness, kill them!

1212
02:10:18.375 --> 02:10:20.416
Kill them all.

1213
02:10:22.083 --> 02:10:24.375
Xiao Qiao!

1214
02:10:24.416 --> 02:10:26.416
Are you both safe?

1215
02:10:26.458 --> 02:10:28.291
We are both fine.

1216
02:10:32.583 --> 02:10:34.416
We lost!

1217
02:10:34.458 --> 02:10:36.625
All because of you!

1218
02:10:37.458 --> 02:10:40.000
Kneel down before me.

1219
02:10:49.000 --> 02:10:52.375
Kneel to me and I will spare Xiao Qiao.

1220
02:10:52.416 --> 02:10:53.875
We won't let you harm her.

1221
02:10:53.916 --> 02:10:55.666
"We"?

1222
02:10:55.750 --> 02:10:58.375
You mean"them"?

1223
02:10:58.416 --> 02:11:00.625
That motley troop?

1224
02:11:00.708 --> 02:11:02.333
They are my friends.

1225
02:11:04.375 --> 02:11:06.125
War knows no friends.

1226
02:11:06.208 --> 02:11:09.625
Tomorrow, they shall be your enemies.

1227
02:11:14.333 --> 02:11:16.041
General!

1228
02:11:16.125 --> 02:11:18.458
Push her off! Die!

1229
02:11:36.750 --> 02:11:38.250
Your Honor!

1230
02:11:56.166 --> 02:11:57.583
Are you both all right?

1231
02:12:17.416 --> 02:12:19.125
Let's go.

1232
02:12:21.083 --> 02:12:23.541
I promise I will take you home.

1233
02:13:14.375 --> 02:13:16.583
Go.

1234
02:13:16.666 --> 02:13:20.125
Go back to where you came from.

1235
02:13:47.500 --> 02:13:49.041
There is no victor here.

1236
02:14:37.700 --> 02:14:39.117
Meng Meng.

1237
02:14:40.409 --> 02:14:43.200
Go on now, go.

1238
02:14:54.909 --> 02:14:56.534
Meng Meng.

1239
02:15:06.617 --> 02:15:09.492
From division comes unity,
and from unity, division...

1240
02:15:09.575 --> 02:15:12.075
...Liu Bei won't stand being second best.

1241
02:15:12.159 --> 02:15:15.450
One day, we will face
each other on the battlefield.

1242
02:15:15.534 --> 02:15:19.325
No man can tell the future.

1243
02:15:19.409 --> 02:15:21.534
The world is full of heroes.

1244
02:15:21.617 --> 02:15:26.034
But you're the one I most fear offending.

1245
02:15:26.075 --> 02:15:27.700
You would be an opponent I truly fear.

1246
02:15:27.784 --> 02:15:29.159
Me?

1247
02:15:29.242 --> 02:15:32.409
I'd best return home and get some sleep.

1248
02:15:32.492 --> 02:15:34.409
Are you a good farmer?

1249
02:15:34.450 --> 02:15:36.450
I planted lotus flowers once...

1250
02:15:36.534 --> 02:15:38.617
...but none lived long.

1251
02:15:38.700 --> 02:15:41.450
Do not be humble
You have brought peace to the land.

1252
02:15:44.325 --> 02:15:48.159
In this alliance, I found true friends.

1253
02:15:48.242 --> 02:15:50.159
No matter what may happen,

1254
02:15:50.242 --> 02:15:51.659
...this experience is engraved in my heart.

1255
02:15:51.742 --> 02:15:54.200
I too will not forget.

1256
02:16:01.200 --> 02:16:02.200
Zhu-ge Liang,

1257
02:16:02.284 --> 02:16:05.284
...when Meng Meng has grown,
do not make her a war horse.

1258
02:16:05.367 --> 02:16:06.825
Don't worry.

1259
02:16:06.909 --> 02:16:09.409
These hands helped birth her.

1260
02:16:09.492 --> 02:16:11.492
I shall always cherish her.
